  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This talent cannot be gained temporarily. When you gain this talent, choose a skill sphere for each retainer profession you have access to. Each of your retainers gain the sphere you chose for their profession as a bonus sphere and treat a skill associated with that sphere as an extra primary skill (GM’s choice if there are multiple). No more than one of the spheres you choose with this talent can be one you do not already have access to; the rest must either be ones you have or ones that are available to another retainer profession you have. When you gain access to a new profession of retainer, you choose a bonus sphere for it.</p>\n<p>You can choose this talent multiple times. Each time you do, you can choose another sphere for each profession you have access to and only one of the spheres chosen can be one you did not already have access to either yourself or via another retainer profession.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/faction#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
